#!/usr/bin/env bash
set -Eeuo pipefail

cat <<'EOF'
This project does not bundle Apple assets or third-party macOS clone themes.

For a more macOS-like appearance, use KDE System Settings:
  Appearance > Global Theme > Get New...
  Icons > Get New...
  Cursors > Get New...

Search for actively maintained themes such as "WhiteSur" or "McMojave", inspect
their source and licensing, then install through KDE's store interface.

The built-in layout already supplies the top panel, global menu location, bottom
dock, KRunner on Meta+Space and Finder-like Dolphin defaults.
EOF
